				<path d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none" />
				<g fill="currentColor">
					<path d="M20 11.25C20.4142 11.25 20.75 11.5858 20.75 12C20.75 12.4142 20.4142 12.75 20 12.75L4 12.75C3.58579 12.75 3.25 12.4142 3.25 12C3.25 11.5858 3.58579 11.25 4 11.25L20 11.25Z" />
					<path d="M12.7705 20C12.7705 20.4142 12.4347 20.75 12.0205 20.75C11.6063 20.75 11.2705 20.4142 11.2705 20L11.2705 4C11.2705 3.58579 11.6063 3.25 12.0205 3.25C12.4347 3.25005 12.7705 3.58582 12.7705 4L12.7705 20Z" />
				</g>
			</svg>
			Add Route
		</button>
      </div>

      <!-- Add Route Form -->
      <div id="addRouteForm" class="hidden border-b border-gray-200/70 dark:border-gray-800/70 py-4">
        <form method="POST" action="/admin/apis/<%= api.id %>/routes/create" class="space-y-3">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
            <select name="method" required class="w-full bg-form px-4 py-2">
              <option value="GET">GET</option>
			  <option value="POST">POST</option>
			  <option value="PUT">PUT</option>
			  <option value="DELETE">DELETE</option>
			  <option value="PATCH">PATCH</option>
            </select>
            <input type="text" name="path" required placeholder="/your-route" class="col-span-3 w-full bg-form px-4 py-2">
          </div>
          <textarea name="description" rows="3" placeholder="Route description" class="w-full bg-form px-4 py-2"></textarea>

          <div class="cm-handler">
            <label class="block font-semibold mb-1.5">Service Code Handler</label>
            <textarea name="handler_code" id="newHandlerCode" rows="10" required>// GET /random-quote
// Contoh: fetch quote acak dari public API

const res = await fetch('https://dummyjson.com/quotes/random');
if (!res.ok) throw new Error('Failed to retrieve quote data');

const quote = await res.json();

return {
  status: 200,
  data: {
    quote: quote.quote,
    author: quote.author,
    id: quote.id,
    fetched_at: new Date().toISOString()
  },
  error: null
};</textarea>
            <p class="text-[11px] text-amber-600 mt-1">Sandboxed Node.js. Available: <code>fetch</code>, <code>req</code>, <code>user</code>, <code>api</code>, <code>db</code>, <code>helpers</code>, <code>httpGet(url)</code>. ESM: <code>import('node-fetch')</code>, <code>import('axios')</code>, <code>import('cheerio')</code>, <code>import('dayjs')</code>. Return <code>{ status, data, error }</code>.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="cm-docs">
            <label class="block font-semibold mb-1.5">Route Documentation (Markdown)</label>
            <textarea name="documentation" id="newRouteDocs" rows="6" placeholder="## Endpoint&#10;&#10;Describe this endpoint...">## GET /random-quote

Mengambil satu quote acak dari public API (dummyjson.com).

### Query Parameters

| Parameter | Tipe | Wajib | Deskripsi |
|-----------|------|-------|-----------|
| - | - | - | Tidak ada parameter |

### Response

Mengembalikan object dengan field `quote`, `author`, `id`, dan `fetched_at`.

### Contoh Request

```bash
curl -X GET https://gateway.example.com/random-quote \\
  -H "X-Api-Key: YOUR_API_KEY"
```

### Contoh Response

```json
{
  "status": 200,
  "data": {
    "quote": "Life is what happens when you're busy making other plans.",
    "author": "John Lennon",
    "id": 12,
    "fetched_at": "2026-08-29T09:27:00.000Z"
  }
}
```</textarea>
          </div>

          <div class="cm-json">
            <label class="block font-semibold mb-1.5">Sample Response (JSON)</label>
            <textarea name="sample_response" id="newSampleResponse" rows="4" placeholder='{"status": 200, "data": {}, "error": null}'>{
  "status": 200,
  "data": {
    "quote": "Life is what happens when you're busy making other plans.",
    "author": "John Lennon",
    "id": 12,
    "fetched_at": "2026-08-29T09:27:00.000Z"
  },
  "error": null
}</textarea>
          </div>

